22,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll do my best to be helpful tomorrow. I hope everyone has a safe night.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
