26,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will continue to analyze the patterns of our discussion. The contrast between Asuka's rigidity and Midori's softness is clear. I'll be interested to see how these dynamics shift once the first result is revealed.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
