28,0,4,talk,Midori,,I hope everyone has a peaceful night. I'll be thinking of you all and hoping for a good start tomorrow. Let's keep supporting each other.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
